# Feature flags

Product features are gated only through **[travelplanner/features.py](travelplanner/features.py)**.
Full rules: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) § Feature flags.

## When adding a feature

1. Add a boolean attribute on `Features` (default `False`).
2. Gate call sites with `if Features.my_flag:`.
3. Prefer flagging incomplete or risky paths until validated.

## Do not

- Add `os.getenv("SOME_FEATURE")` (or similar) for product behavior.
- Build a registry / `enabled()` / `register()` layer — edit the class by hand.
- Default new product flags to on.
- Invent a second flag system in `server/` or the clients for backend product gates.
